{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01TkSzZyiq3E4Ryp3LptaFVg","type":"tool_result","content":"1\tnarrative_guidance: '所有核心假设成立。SimGate 在 CogRouter protocol 下达到 90.2（vs CogRouter 84.6），\n2\t  death avoidance 贡献约 70% 的增益，positive guidance 信号在 4-5 个 task type 出现作为补充发现。 Explicit\n3\t  router 显著优于 implicit baseline（+11.4），routing heatmap 产出清晰的 failure taxonomy。 叙事无需任何退让，reviewer\n4\t  concern 1 靠数据压制。\n5\t\n6\t  '\n7\timagined_experiments:\n8\t- name: Counterfactual Trajectory Collection (15+ task types)\n9\t  plan_id: plan-001\n10\t  description: 'Qwen2.5-7B agent 在 ScienceWorld 18 个 task type 上各跑 20 episodes（max_steps=30），\n11\t    每步 fork 3 modalities（fast-internal, deep-internal, deterministic），hindsight labeling\n12\t    生成 (state, observation, best_modality) 三元组。vLLM 后端双卡并行。\n13\t\n14\t    '\n15\t  expected_results:\n16\t    total_episodes: 360\n17\t    total_steps_collected: ~8200\n18\t    avg_steps_per_episode: 22.8\n19\t    label_distribution_fast_internal_pct: 38\n20\t    label_distribution_deep_internal_pct: 24\n21\t    label_distribution_deterministic_pct: 38\n22\t    deterministic_label_death_avoidance_pct: 72\n23\t    deterministic_label_positive_guidance_pct: 28\n24\t    task_types_completed: 18\n25\t    task_types_with_clear_det_advantage: 15\n26\t    internal_mean_pooled: -47.3\n27\t    det_mean_pooled: -11.8\n28\t    oracle_mean_pooled: 5.6\n29\t    wall_clock_hours: 34\n30\t  result_rationale: 'MVP 已在 melt/change_state 上观察到 det_minus_internal ~40 分，boil 类似。\n31\t    Best 档下，扩展到 18 个 task type 后，物理推理类（boil, melt, freeze, change-state, thermometer,\n32\t    mix-paint 等 ~10 类）保持强 deterministic 优势（避免温度/状态转换幻觉致死）； 生物类（grow-plant, use-fertilizer\n33\t    等 ~3 类）因多步因果链也有中等优势； 纯导航/简单操作类（move-to, pick-up 等 ~3 类）deterministic 无优势。 15/18\n34\t    task type 出现显著 det 增益符合 best 档 [12,15] 范围上限。 Deterministic label 中 72% 来自 death\n35\t    avoidance（agent 原始动作会导致 -100 惩罚）， 28% 来自 positive guidance（simulator 纠正状态推理，agent\n36\t    虽不会死但会走错路）， 这个 28% 是 best 档的关键发现——不仅避死，还有正向纠偏。 双卡 vLLM 并行 18 type × 20 ep，每 ep\n37\t    平均 23 步 × 3 fork， 基于 MVP 的 1.67s/fork latency，预计 34 小时完成（含排队和 IO）。\n38\t\n39\t    '\n40\t  tables: []\n41\t  figures_description: []\n42\t  analysis: ''\n43\t- name: Router SFT Training (Qwen3-1.7B)\n44\t  plan_id: plan-002\n45\t  description: '在 plan-001 的 ~8200 条 counterfactual label 上 SFT Qwen3-1.7B。 输入 (history,\n46\t    observation)，输出 3-class routing decision。 80/20 split by episode，lr=2e-5, batch=32,\n47\t    epochs=3, max_seq_len=2048。\n48\t\n49\t    '\n50\t  expected_results:\n51\t    train_samples: ~6560\n52\t    val_samples: ~1640\n53\t    val_accuracy_pct: 81.3\n54\t    val_accuracy_deterministic_class_pct: 84.7\n55\t    val_accuracy_internal_classes_pct: 78.9\n56\t    val_f1_macro: 0.79\n57\t    train_loss_final: 0.42\n58\t    val_loss_final: 0.51\n59\t    training_wall_clock_hours: 5.2\n60\t    convergence_epoch: 2.4\n61\t    train_val_gap_accuracy_pct: 6.8\n62\t  result_rationale: 'Best 档要求 router_accuracy 75-85%，val accuracy 81.3% 落在区间中上。 Deterministic\n63\t    class 准确率更高（84.7%）因为 death-avoidance 场景有强信号： agent 即将执行物理违规操作时 observation 中包含明确的状态冲突线索\n64\t    （如 \"the water is already at 100°C\" + agent 尝试继续加热），这些 pattern 对 1.7B 模型 来说是可学习的文本特征。Internal\n65\t    class 稍低（78.9%）因为 fast 和 deep 的边界 更模糊。Train-val gap 6.8% 表明轻微过拟合但可控，无需 DAgger。\n66\t    Counterfactual label 跨 task type 泛化良好（A4 成立），因为物理规则违规的 文本 pattern 跨 task type\n67\t    共享（温度、状态转换、化学反应的 observation 格式一致）。\n68\t\n69\t    '\n70\t  tables: []\n71\t  figures_description: []\n72\t  analysis: ''\n73\t- name: SimGate End-to-End Evaluation\n74\t  plan_id: plan-003\n75\t  description: 'Trained router + Qwen2.5-7B backbone 在 held-out episodes 上评估。 对比 always-internal,\n76\t    always-deterministic, oracle-routing, random-routing, confidence-threshold heuristic。CogRouter\n77\t    protocol 打分。Bootstrap 90% CI。\n78\t\n79\t    '\n80\t  expected_results:\n81\t    simgate_score_overall: 90.2\n82\t    always_internal_score: 52.8\n83\t    always_deterministic_score: 73.4\n84\t    oracle_routing_score: 93.1\n85\t    random_routing_score: 64.5\n86\t    confidence_heuristic_score: 71.8\n87\t    simgate_minus_always_internal: 37.4\n88\t    simgate_minus_always_det: 16.8\n89\t    oracle_minus_always_det: 19.7\n90\t    oracle_minus_simgate: 2.9\n91\t    simgate_vs_cogrouter: +5.6 (90.2 vs 84.6)\n92\t    simgate_vs_itpr: +27.6 (90.2 vs 62.58)\n93\t    catastrophic_failure_rate_internal_pct: 42.3\n94\t    catastrophic_failure_rate_simgate_pct: 11.7\n95\t    catastrophic_failure_reduction_pct: 72.3\n96\t    simulator_invocation_ratio_pct: 34.2\n97\t    total_llm_tokens_simgate_vs_always_det_pct: -58\n98\t    bootstrap_90ci_simgate:\n99\t    - 87.1\n100\t    - 93.3\n101\t    bootstrap_90ci_delta_vs_internal:\n102\t    - 31.2\n103\t    - 43.6\n104\t    task_types_with_significant_gain: 14\n105\t    per_task_breakdown_top5:\n106\t      boil:\n107\t        simgate: 95.2\n108\t        internal: 38.4\n109\t        det: 78.6\n110\t      melt:\n111\t        simgate: 93.8\n112\t        internal: 41.2\n113\t        det: 80.1\n114\t      change_state:\n115\t        simgate: 94.1\n116\t        internal: 39.5\n117\t        det: 79.3\n118\t      freeze:\n119\t        simgate: 92.7\n120\t        internal: 43.8\n121\t        det: 81.2\n122\t      mix_paint:\n123\t        simgate: 88.4\n124\t        internal: 56.3\n125\t        det: 72.1\n126\t    per_task_breakdown_bottom3:\n127\t      pick_up:\n128\t        simgate: 84.2\n129\t        internal: 82.1\n130\t        det: 68.3\n131\t      move_to:\n132\t        simgate: 81.5\n133\t        internal: 80.8\n134\t        det: 64.7\n135\t      open_door:\n136\t        simgate: 83.1\n137\t        internal: 81.4\n138\t        det: 66.2\n139\t  result_rationale: 'SimGate 90.2 落在 best 档 [85,95] 中上，超过 CogRouter 84.6 约 5.6 分。\n140\t    核心机制：always-internal 52.8 极低是因为约 42% episodes 出现 catastrophic failure （-100 death\n141\t    penalty），SimGate 将这一比率降至 11.7%（72.3% reduction，在 [60,80] 范围内）， 这直接贡献了 +37.4 分中的约\n142\t    26 分（death avoidance 主机制）。 剩余 ~11 分来自：(a) positive guidance 在 4-5 个 task type\n143\t    上纠正状态推理 ~+6 分， (b) 避免非致命但低效的 hallucinated action ~+5 分。 Always-deterministic 73.4\n144\t    低于 SimGate 16.8 分（oracle_minus_always_det 19.7 在 [10,20] 上沿）， 因为无条件调用 simulator\n145\t    在不需要的步骤上引入延迟和 context 膨胀， 且 simulator 对纯推理/规划步骤提供冗余信息干扰 agent 决策。 SimGate 仅在 34.2%\n146\t    步骤调用 simulator（在 [25,45] 范围内）， 省下 58% LLM tokens 相比 always-det。 Oracle-SimGate\n147\t    gap 仅 2.9 分，说明 router 接近最优策略。 14/18 task type 有显著增益（best 档 [12,15]），bottom 3 是简单导航/操作类，\n148\t    这些 task type 本身 internal baseline 已 80+，deterministic 反而增加干扰。\n149\t\n150\t    '\n151\t  tables: []\n152\t  figures_description: []\n153\t  analysis: ''\n154\t- name: Explicit vs Implicit Routing Ablation\n155\t  plan_id: plan-004\n156\t  description: '同一 Qwen2.5-7B backbone。Implicit: backbone prompt 中加 \"[SIMULATE]\" tool-use\n157\t    指令， SFT 让 backbone 在 oracle-labeled 步骤输出 [SIMULATE]。Explicit: SimGate router（独立\n158\t    Qwen3-1.7B）。 两者训练数据相同。\n159\t\n160\t    '\n161\t  expected_results:\n162\t    explicit_simgate_score: 90.2\n163\t    implicit_routing_score: 78.8\n164\t    explicit_minus_implicit: 11.4\n165\t    implicit_simulator_invocation_ratio_pct: 52.3\n166\t    explicit_simulator_invocation_ratio_pct: 34.2\n167\t    implicit_catastrophic_failure_rate_pct: 24.1\n168\t    explicit_catastrophic_failure_rate_pct: 11.7\n169\t    implicit_false_positive_rate_pct: 31.4\n170\t    implicit_false_negative_rate_pct: 18.7\n171\t    explicit_false_positive_rate_pct: 12.1\n172\t    explicit_false_negative_rate_pct: 8.3\n173\t    bootstrap_90ci_delta:\n174\t    - 7.2\n175\t    - 15.6\n176\t  result_rationale: 'Explicit vs implicit 差距 11.4 分（在 [8,15] 范围内），原因是三重的： (1) Implicit\n177\t    routing 将 routing 决策和 action 生成耦合在同一 forward pass 中， backbone 在生成 action token\n178\t    时需要同时判断是否 simulate，这两个目标互相干扰。 SFT 在 7B backbone 上教 [SIMULATE] 输出会轻微降低 action 质量（catastrophic\n179\t    failure 从 42.3% 降至 24.1%，但不如 explicit 的 11.7%）。 (2) Implicit routing 过度调用 simulator（52.3%\n180\t    vs 34.2%），因为 backbone 学到了 \"调用 simulator 更安全\" 的 bias 而缺乏精确的 risk 评估能力，导致 context\n181\t    膨胀 和 token 浪费。 (3) Implicit routing 的 false negative 高（18.7% vs 8.3%）——真正需要 simulator\n182\t    的高危步骤被遗漏，因为 backbone attention 被 action generation 分散。 这个 gap 直接支持 C2：explicit\n183\t    modular router 的架构解耦提供了可量化的优势， 不仅仅是工程便利。\n184\t\n185\t    '\n186\t  tables: []\n187\t  figures_description: []\n188\t  analysis: ''\n189\t- name: Per-Task Routing Pattern Analysis\n190\t  plan_id: plan-005\n191\t  description: '基于 plan-003 的 routing decisions，生成：(a) task × phase routing heatmap，\n192\t    (b) failure mode taxonomy，(c) router-as-diagnostic-probe 分析。\n193\t\n194\t    '\n195\t  expected_results:\n196\t    routing_heatmap_dimensions: 18 task_types × 3 phases (early/mid/late)\n197\t    high_routing_cluster_1: 'physical-state-change (boil, melt, freeze, change-state):\n198\t      55-65% det routing, concentrated in mid-phase'\n199\t    high_routing_cluster_2: 'chemical-reaction (mix-paint, react-chemicals): 40-50%\n200\t      det routing, concentrated in mid-to-late phase'\n201\t    medium_routing_cluster_3: 'biological-growth (grow-plant, use-fertilizer): 30-40%\n202\t      det routing, spread across phases'\n203\t    low_routing_cluster_4: 'navigation-manipulation (move-to, pick-up, open-door):\n204\t      5-12% det routing, no phase concentration'\n205\t    failure_mode_taxonomy:\n206\t      FM1_temperature_physics: Agent hallucinates temperature transitions (e.g., predicts\n207\t        boiling at 80°C). 34% of all det-routed steps.\n208\t      FM2_state_persistence: Agent forgets prior state changes (e.g., assumes object\n209\t        still solid after melting). 22% of all det-routed steps.\n210\t      FM3_chemical_combination: Agent predicts wrong reaction products. 18% of all\n211\t        det-routed steps.\n212\t      FM4_multi_step_causality: Agent skips prerequisite steps in causal chains. 15%\n213\t        of all det-routed steps.\n214\t      FM5_quantity_tracking: Agent loses track of quantities/volumes. 11% of all det-routed\n215\t        steps.\n216\t    phase_analysis:\n217\t      early_phase_det_ratio_pct: 18.4\n218\t      mid_phase_det_ratio_pct: 48.7\n219\t      late_phase_det_ratio_pct: 32.9\n220\t    positive_guidance_tasks:\n221\t    - grow-plant\n222\t    - use-thermometer\n223\t    - mix-paint\n224\t    - react-chemicals\n225\t    positive_guidance_contribution_pct: 28\n226\t  result_rationale: 'Best 档下 routing pattern 产出清晰的 4-cluster 结构和 5-class failure taxonomy。\n227\t    物理状态变化类（cluster 1）routing 最密集是因为 ScienceWorld 的温度/状态转换规则 是 LLM 最容易幻觉的领域——LLM 训练数据中物理过程描述与\n228\t    ScienceWorld 的离散 rule-based 物理引擎不一致，导致系统性 failure。 Mid-phase concentration（48.7%）因为\n229\t    early phase 多为导航/设置（低风险）， late phase 多为收尾（状态已确定），mid-phase 是执行物理/化学操作的关键窗口。 Failure\n230\t    taxonomy 中 FM1（温度物理）+ FM2（状态持久性）合计 56%，这两类 都是 LLM 的已知弱点（数值推理 + 长期状态追踪），为 \"router-as-diagnostic\"\n231\t    提供了强叙事支持——router 不仅做 routing，还揭示了 LLM 在哪里系统性地失败。 Positive guidance 在 4 个 task\n232\t    type 上出现（A6+ 成立），主要是 simulator 返回的 ground-truth 状态帮助 agent 修正了错误的中间推理，即使不会致死。\n233\t\n234\t    '\n235\t  tables: []\n236\t  figures_description: []\n237\t  analysis: ''\n238\t- name: 2-way vs 3-way Routing Ablation\n239\t  plan_id: plan-006\n240\t  description: '对比 {internal, deterministic} 二分类 router 与 {fast-internal, deep-internal,\n241\t    deterministic} 三分类 router。测试 fast/deep 区分是否增加额外价值。\n242\t\n243\t    '\n244\t  expected_results:\n245\t    three_way_score: 90.2\n246\t    two_way_score: 87.6\n247\t    delta: 2.6\n248\t    two_way_simulator_invocation_ratio_pct: 36.8\n249\t    three_way_simulator_invocation_ratio_pct: 34.2\n250\t    two_way_total_tokens_vs_three_way_pct: '+18'\n251\t    statistical_significance: p=0.08 (marginal)\n252\t  result_rationale: '3-way 比 2-way 高 2.6 分，差异 marginal（p=0.08）。这是 best 档下的合理预期： fast/deep\n253\t    区分的价值来自 token 效率而非最终 score——2-way router 在 \"internal\"  类别上默认使用 deep reasoning（更多\n254\t    token），导致 +18% token 开销但 score 接近。 少数 task type（简单导航）上 fast-internal 足够，3-way\n255\t    router 在这些步骤节省 token 且略微减少 context 膨胀带来的 attention 分散。 这个结果简化叙事：论文可以说 \"binary\n256\t    simulate-or-not 是核心决策， 3-way routing 提供额外的 compute-efficiency 收益但 score 差异不显著\"，\n257\t    让 story 聚焦在 deterministic routing 的安全价值上。\n258\t\n259\t    '\n260\t  tables: []\n261\t  figures_description: []\n262\t  analysis: ''\n263\t- name: Boil Task Rerun (v3 code)\n264\t  plan_id: plan-007\n265\t  description: '用 v3 clean code 重跑 boil task 20 episodes，替换 MVP 中使用旧代码（>= tie-break,\n266\t    death filter on all 3 modes）的数据。统一分析框架。\n267\t\n268\t    '\n269\t  expected_results:\n270\t    boil_v3_internal_mean: -44.2\n271\t    boil_v3_det_mean: -8.3\n272\t    boil_v3_oracle_mean: 8.7\n273\t    boil_v3_det_minus_internal: 35.9\n274\t    boil_v3_oracle_minus_det: 17.0\n275\t    boil_v3_death_rate_internal_pct: 55\n276\t    boil_v3_death_rate_det_pct: 12\n277\t    bootstrap_90ci_det_minus_internal:\n278\t    - 22.4\n279\t    - 49.4\n280\t    delta_vs_mvp_internal: +5.6 (v3 slightly better due to cleaner death accounting)\n281\t  result_rationale: 'V3 代码修正了两个 MVP 问题：(1) tie-break 从 >= 改为严格最优， (2) death filter\n282\t    逻辑统一。这使 internal baseline 略微上升（-44.2 vs MVP -49.8）， 因为 tie-break 修正避免了部分不必要的 deterministic\n283\t    label 被标为 \"best\"。 Deterministic 也上升（-8.3 vs MVP -19.7），因为 death filter 现在正确过滤了\n284\t    deterministic 模式本身的 spurious death（MVP 中未过滤导致虚高的 death penalty）。 Oracle 从 -29.7\n285\t    跃升至 8.7，因为 v3 代码的 hindsight labeling 更准确， 选择了真正最优的 modality 而非被 tie-break 偏差的\n286\t    modality。 核心信号不变：det_minus_internal 35.9 分，death rate 从 55% 降至 12%， 与 melt/change_state\n287\t    的 pattern 一致，支持 pooled analysis。\n288\t\n289\t    '\n290\t  tables: []\n291\t  figures_description: []\n292\t  analysis: ''\n293\t- name: Router Size Ablation\n294\t  plan_id: plan-008\n295\t  description: '对比 Qwen3-1.7B vs Qwen2.5-1.5B vs Qwen2.5-3B 作为 router。 同一训练数据和超参数。\n296\t\n297\t    '\n298\t  expected_results:\n299\t    qwen3_1_7b_accuracy_pct: 81.3\n300\t    qwen3_1_7b_simgate_score: 90.2\n301\t    qwen2_5_1_5b_accuracy_pct: 76.8\n302\t    qwen2_5_1_5b_simgate_score: 86.9\n303\t    qwen2_5_3b_accuracy_pct: 82.1\n304\t    qwen2_5_3b_simgate_score: 90.8\n305\t    inference_latency_1_5b_ms: 12\n306\t    inference_latency_1_7b_ms: 14\n307\t    inference_latency_3b_ms: 23\n308\t  result_rationale: 'Best 档下三个 router 都在可用范围内，但 Qwen3-1.7B 是最佳性价比： 1.5B 准确率下降 4.5%（76.8%），对应\n309\t    SimGate score 降 3.3 分至 86.9—— 仍超过 CogRouter 但 margin 收窄。下降主要来自 false negative\n310\t    增加 （遗漏高危步骤），因为 1.5B 的 context 理解能力不足以识别微妙的状态冲突。 3B 仅比 1.7B 高 0.8%（82.1%），对应 SimGate\n311\t    +0.6 分——收益递减， 而推理延迟增加 64%（23ms vs 14ms）。 这支持 \"lightweight router suffices\" 的主张：1.7B\n312\t    是 sweet spot， 1.5B 勉强可用但 margin 不够舒适，3B 无额外价值但增加开销。\n313\t\n314\t    '\n315\t  tables: []\n316\t  figures_description: []\n317\t  analysis: ''\n318\t- name: MATH Track — Code Interpreter Routing\n319\t  plan_id: plan-009\n320\t  description: '500 道 MATH Level 4-5 问题。3-way routing: fast-internal / deep-internal\n321\t    / code-interpreter。 验证 SimGate 框架泛化到代码解释器。\n322\t\n323\t    '\n324\t  expected_results:\n325\t    simgate_math_accuracy_pct: 71.4\n326\t    always_internal_accuracy_pct: 58.2\n327\t    always_code_accuracy_pct: 64.8\n328\t    oracle_accuracy_pct: 76.3\n329\t    code_invocation_ratio_pct: 38.5\n330\t    delta_simgate_vs_internal: 13.2\n331\t    delta_simgate_vs_always_code: 6.6\n332\t    high_gain_categories:\n333\t    - algebra\n334\t    - number-theory\n335\t    - counting-probability\n336\t    low_gain_categories:\n337\t    - geometry\n338\t    - precalculus\n339\t  result_rationale: 'MATH 上 SimGate 的增益模式与 ScienceWorld 类似但幅度较小： code interpreter\n340\t    在代数和数论上提供 ground-truth 计算，避免 LLM 的算术错误 （类似 ScienceWorld 的 death avoidance——算错\n341\t    → 全题错 → 0 分）。 Always-code 低于 SimGate 6.6 分，因为几何和预微积分问题需要 空间推理和符号操作，code interpreter\n342\t    反而不如 LLM 的 chain-of-thought。 Oracle 76.3% 设定了上限——并非所有 MATH 错误都能通过 routing 解决 （部分问题\n343\t    LLM 和 code interpreter 都做不对）。 这个结果作为 P2 补充实验，证明 \"safety-aware routing\" 框架 泛化到\n344\t    deterministic computation 的其他形式（code interpreter）， 但不列入 main text（short paper\n345\t    聚焦 ScienceWorld），放 appendix 或 future work 段落。\n346\t\n347\t    '\n348\t  tables: []\n349\t  figures_description: []\n350\t  analysis: ''\n351\t- name: Cross-Task Transfer\n352\t  plan_id: plan-010\n353\t  description: 'Train router on chemistry tasks only → evaluate on physics tasks（及反向）。\n354\t    测试 routing pattern 是否跨 task domain 迁移。\n355\t\n356\t    '\n357\t  expected_results:\n358\t    chemistry_train_physics_eval_accuracy_pct: 73.2\n359\t    physics_train_chemistry_eval_accuracy_pct: 70.8\n360\t    full_train_accuracy_pct: 81.3\n361\t    chemistry_to_physics_simgate_score: 85.4\n362\t    physics_to_chemistry_simgate_score: 83.1\n363\t    transfer_gap_pct: 8.1\n364\t    shared_failure_modes_pct: 62\n365\t  result_rationale: Cross-task transfer 展示了 moderate 的泛化能力（准确率下降 ~8-10%）， 这在 best\n366\t    档下是合理的：chemistry 和 physics task 共享 62% 的 failure modes （FM1 温度物理和 FM2 状态持久性在两个\n367\t    domain 都出现），所以 router 学到的 \"observation 中出现状态冲突信号 → route to deterministic\" 的 pattern\n368\t    可以迁移。 下降的 8-10% 来自 domain-specific failure modes（化学反应产物 vs 物理量守恒）， 这些 pattern\n369\t    在跨域训练中未见过。 Chemistry→Physics transfer 略优于反向（73.2% vs 70.8%），因为化学 task  的 failure\n370\t    pattern 更多样（反应类型多），提供了更丰富的训练信号。 这个结果支持 A4（counterfactual labels 跨 task type 泛化良好），\n371\t    同时说明 full-task 训练仍有价值——router 不是纯 domain-agnostic 的， 但共享的物理/状态推理 failure pattern\n372\t    提供了可迁移的基础。\n373\t  tables: []\n374\t  figures_description: []\n375\t  analysis: ''\n376\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"6a0c8153-cc84-4377-89ae-d65d2a8c9d37","uuid":"31ed62c3-dd6a-4daa-be81-b0253761ef00","timestamp":"2026-05-13T16:04:49.826Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_12/projects/simgate-modular-routing/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260513T153257/best/review_context.yaml","content":"narrative_guidance: '所有核心假设成立。SimGate 在 CogRouter protocol 下达到 90.2（vs CogRouter 84.6），\n  death avoidance 贡献约 70% 的增益，positive guidance 信号在 4-5 个 task type 出现作为补充发现。 Explicit\n  router 显著优于 implicit baseline（+11.4），routing heatmap 产出清晰的 failure taxonomy。 叙事无需任何退让，reviewer\n  concern 1 靠数据压制。\n\n  '\nimagined_experiments:\n- name: Counterfactual Trajectory Collection (15+ task types)\n  plan_id: plan-001\n  description: 'Qwen2.5-7B agent 在 ScienceWorld 18 个 task type 上各跑 20 episodes（max_steps=30），\n    每步 fork 3 modalities（fast-internal, deep-internal, deterministic），hindsight labeling\n    生成 (state, observation, best_modality) 三元组。vLLM 后端双卡并行。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    total_episodes: 360\n    total_steps_collected: ~8200\n    avg_steps_per_episode: 22.8\n    label_distribution_fast_internal_pct: 38\n    label_distribution_deep_internal_pct: 24\n    label_distribution_deterministic_pct: 38\n    deterministic_label_death_avoidance_pct: 72\n    deterministic_label_positive_guidance_pct: 28\n    task_types_completed: 18\n    task_types_with_clear_det_advantage: 15\n    internal_mean_pooled: -47.3\n    det_mean_pooled: -11.8\n    oracle_mean_pooled: 5.6\n    wall_clock_hours: 34\n  result_rationale: 'MVP 已在 melt/change_state 上观察到 det_minus_internal ~40 分，boil 类似。\n    Best 档下，扩展到 18 个 task type 后，物理推理类（boil, melt, freeze, change-state, thermometer,\n    mix-paint 等 ~10 类）保持强 deterministic 优势（避免温度/状态转换幻觉致死）； 生物类（grow-plant, use-fertilizer\n    等 ~3 类）因多步因果链也有中等优势； 纯导航/简单操作类（move-to, pick-up 等 ~3 类）deterministic 无优势。 15/18\n    task type 出现显著 det 增益符合 best 档 [12,15] 范围上限。 Deterministic label 中 72% 来自 death\n    avoidance（agent 原始动作会导致 -100 惩罚）， 28% 来自 positive guidance（simulator 纠正状态推理，agent\n    虽不会死但会走错路）， 这个 28% 是 best 档的关键发现——不仅避死，还有正向纠偏。 双卡 vLLM 并行 18 type × 20 ep，每 ep\n    平均 23 步 × 3 fork， 基于 MVP 的 1.67s/fork latency，预计 34 小时完成（含排队和 IO）。\n\n    '\n  tables: []\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: ''\n- name: Router SFT Training (Qwen3-1.7B)\n  plan_id: plan-002\n  description: '在 plan-001 的 ~8200 条 counterfactual label 上 SFT Qwen3-1.7B。 输入 (history,\n    observation)，输出 3-class routing decision。 80/20 split by episode，lr=2e-5, batch=32,\n    epochs=3, max_seq_len=2048。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    train_samples: ~6560\n    val_samples: ~1640\n    val_accuracy_pct: 81.3\n    val_accuracy_deterministic_class_pct: 84.7\n    val_accuracy_internal_classes_pct: 78.9\n    val_f1_macro: 0.79\n    train_loss_final: 0.42\n    val_loss_final: 0.51\n    training_wall_clock_hours: 5.2\n    convergence_epoch: 2.4\n    train_val_gap_accuracy_pct: 6.8\n  result_rationale: 'Best 档要求 router_accuracy 75-85%，val accuracy 81.3% 落在区间中上。 Deterministic\n    class 准确率更高（84.7%）因为 death-avoidance 场景有强信号： agent 即将执行物理违规操作时 observation 中包含明确的状态冲突线索\n    （如 \"the water is already at 100°C\" + agent 尝试继续加热），这些 pattern 对 1.7B 模型 来说是可学习的文本特征。Internal\n    class 稍低（78.9%）因为 fast 和 deep 的边界 更模糊。Train-val gap 6.8% 表明轻微过拟合但可控，无需 DAgger。\n    Counterfactual label 跨 task type 泛化良好（A4 成立），因为物理规则违规的 文本 pattern 跨 task type\n    共享（温度、状态转换、化学反应的 observation 格式一致）。\n\n    '\n  tables: []\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: ''\n- name: SimGate End-to-End Evaluation\n  plan_id: plan-003\n  description: 'Trained router + Qwen2.5-7B backbone 在 held-out episodes 上评估。 对比 always-internal,\n    always-deterministic, oracle-routing, random-routing, confidence-threshold heuristic。CogRouter\n    protocol 打分。Bootstrap 90% CI。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    simgate_score_overall: 90.2\n    always_internal_score: 52.8\n    always_deterministic_score: 73.4\n    oracle_routing_score: 93.1\n    random_routing_score: 64.5\n    confidence_heuristic_score: 71.8\n    simgate_minus_always_internal: 37.4\n    simgate_minus_always_det: 16.8\n    oracle_minus_always_det: 19.7\n    oracle_minus_simgate: 2.9\n    simgate_vs_cogrouter: +5.6 (90.2 vs 84.6)\n    simgate_vs_itpr: +27.6 (90.2 vs 62.58)\n    catastrophic_failure_rate_internal_pct: 42.3\n    catastrophic_failure_rate_simgate_pct: 11.7\n    catastrophic_failure_reduction_pct: 72.3\n    simulator_invocation_ratio_pct: 34.2\n    total_llm_tokens_simgate_vs_always_det_pct: -58\n    bootstrap_90ci_simgate:\n    - 87.1\n    - 93.3\n    bootstrap_90ci_delta_vs_internal:\n    - 31.2\n    - 43.6\n    task_types_with_significant_gain: 14\n    per_task_breakdown_top5:\n      boil:\n        simgate: 95.2\n        internal: 38.4\n        det: 78.6\n      melt:\n        simgate: 93.8\n        internal: 41.2\n        det: 80.1\n      change_state:\n        simgate: 94.1\n        internal: 39.5\n        det: 79.3\n      freeze:\n        simgate: 92.7\n        internal: 43.8\n        det: 81.2\n      mix_paint:\n        simgate: 88.4\n        internal: 56.3\n        det: 72.1\n    per_task_breakdown_bottom3:\n      pick_up:\n        simgate: 84.2\n        internal: 82.1\n        det: 68.3\n      move_to:\n        simgate: 81.5\n        internal: 80.8\n        det: 64.7\n      open_door:\n        simgate: 83.1\n        internal: 81.4\n        det: 66.2\n  result_rationale: 'SimGate 90.2 落在 best 档 [85,95] 中上，超过 CogRouter 84.6 约 5.6 分。\n    核心机制：always-internal 52.8 极低是因为约 42% episodes 出现 catastrophic failure （-100 death\n    penalty），SimGate 将这一比率降至 11.7%（72.3% reduction，在 [60,80] 范围内）， 这直接贡献了 +37.4 分中的约\n    26 分（death avoidance 主机制）。 剩余 ~11 分来自：(a) positive guidance 在 4-5 个 task type\n    上纠正状态推理 ~+6 分， (b) 避免非致命但低效的 hallucinated action ~+5 分。 Always-deterministic 73.4\n    低于 SimGate 16.8 分（oracle_minus_always_det 19.7 在 [10,20] 上沿）， 因为无条件调用 simulator\n    在不需要的步骤上引入延迟和 context 膨胀， 且 simulator 对纯推理/规划步骤提供冗余信息干扰 agent 决策。 SimGate 仅在 34.2%\n    步骤调用 simulator（在 [25,45] 范围内）， 省下 58% LLM tokens 相比 always-det。 Oracle-SimGate\n    gap 仅 2.9 分，说明 router 接近最优策略。 14/18 task type 有显著增益（best 档 [12,15]），bottom 3 是简单导航/操作类，\n    这些 task type 本身 internal baseline 已 80+，deterministic 反而增加干扰。\n\n    '\n  tables: []\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: ''\n- name: Explicit vs Implicit Routing Ablation\n  plan_id: plan-004\n  description: '同一 Qwen2.5-7B backbone。Implicit: backbone prompt 中加 \"[SIMULATE]\" tool-use\n    指令， SFT 让 backbone 在 oracle-labeled 步骤输出 [SIMULATE]。Explicit: SimGate router（独立\n    Qwen3-1.7B）。 两者训练数据相同。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    explicit_simgate_score: 90.2\n    implicit_routing_score: 78.8\n    explicit_minus_implicit: 11.4\n    implicit_simulator_invocation_ratio_pct: 52.3\n    explicit_simulator_invocation_ratio_pct: 34.2\n    implicit_catastrophic_failure_rate_pct: 24.1\n    explicit_catastrophic_failure_rate_pct: 11.7\n    implicit_false_positive_rate_pct: 31.4\n    implicit_false_negative_rate_pct: 18.7\n    explicit_false_positive_rate_pct: 12.1\n    explicit_false_negative_rate_pct: 8.3\n    bootstrap_90ci_delta:\n    - 7.2\n    - 15.6\n  result_rationale: 'Explicit vs implicit 差距 11.4 分（在 [8,15] 范围内），原因是三重的： (1) Implicit\n    routing 将 routing 决策和 action 生成耦合在同一 forward pass 中， backbone 在生成 action token\n    时需要同时判断是否 simulate，这两个目标互相干扰。 SFT 在 7B backbone 上教 [SIMULATE] 输出会轻微降低 action 质量（catastrophic\n    failure 从 42.3% 降至 24.1%，但不如 explicit 的 11.7%）。 (2) Implicit routing 过度调用 simulator（52.3%\n    vs 34.2%），因为 backbone 学到了 \"调用 simulator 更安全\" 的 bias 而缺乏精确的 risk 评估能力，导致 context\n    膨胀 和 token 浪费。 (3) Implicit routing 的 false negative 高（18.7% vs 8.3%）——真正需要 simulator\n    的高危步骤被遗漏，因为 backbone attention 被 action generation 分散。 这个 gap 直接支持 C2：explicit\n    modular router 的架构解耦提供了可量化的优势， 不仅仅是工程便利。\n\n    '\n  tables: []\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: ''\n- name: Per-Task Routing Pattern Analysis\n  plan_id: plan-005\n  description: '基于 plan-003 的 routing decisions，生成：(a) task × phase routing heatmap，\n    (b) failure mode taxonomy，(c) router-as-diagnostic-probe 分析。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    routing_heatmap_dimensions: 18 task_types × 3 phases (early/mid/late)\n    high_routing_cluster_1: 'physical-state-change (boil, melt, freeze, change-state):\n      55-65% det routing, concentrated in mid-phase'\n    high_routing_cluster_2: 'chemical-reaction (mix-paint, react-chemicals): 40-50%\n      det routing, concentrated in mid-to-late phase'\n    medium_routing_cluster_3: 'biological-growth (grow-plant, use-fertilizer): 30-40%\n      det routing, spread across phases'\n    low_routing_cluster_4: 'navigation-manipulation (move-to, pick-up, open-door):\n      5-12% det routing, no phase concentration'\n    failure_mode_taxonomy:\n      FM1_temperature_physics: Agent hallucinates temperature transitions (e.g., predicts\n        boiling at 80°C). 34% of all det-routed steps.\n      FM2_state_persistence: Agent forgets prior state changes (e.g., assumes object\n        still solid after melting). 22% of all det-routed steps.\n      FM3_chemical_combination: Agent predicts wrong reaction products. 18% of all\n        det-routed steps.\n      FM4_multi_step_causality: Agent skips prerequisite steps in causal chains. 15%\n        of all det-routed steps.\n      FM5_quantity_tracking: Agent loses track of quantities/volumes. 11% of all det-routed\n        steps.\n    phase_analysis:\n      early_phase_det_ratio_pct: 18.4\n      mid_phase_det_ratio_pct: 48.7\n      late_phase_det_ratio_pct: 32.9\n    positive_guidance_tasks:\n    - grow-plant\n    - use-thermometer\n    - mix-paint\n    - react-chemicals\n    positive_guidance_contribution_pct: 28\n  result_rationale: 'Best 档下 routing pattern 产出清晰的 4-cluster 结构和 5-class failure taxonomy。\n    物理状态变化类（cluster 1）routing 最密集是因为 ScienceWorld 的温度/状态转换规则 是 LLM 最容易幻觉的领域——LLM 训练数据中物理过程描述与\n    ScienceWorld 的离散 rule-based 物理引擎不一致，导致系统性 failure。 Mid-phase concentration（48.7%）因为\n    early phase 多为导航/设置（低风险）， late phase 多为收尾（状态已确定），mid-phase 是执行物理/化学操作的关键窗口。 Failure\n    taxonomy 中 FM1（温度物理）+ FM2（状态持久性）合计 56%，这两类 都是 LLM 的已知弱点（数值推理 + 长期状态追踪），为 \"router-as-diagnostic\"\n    提供了强叙事支持——router 不仅做 routing，还揭示了 LLM 在哪里系统性地失败。 Positive guidance 在 4 个 task\n    type 上出现（A6+ 成立），主要是 simulator 返回的 ground-truth 状态帮助 agent 修正了错误的中间推理，即使不会致死。\n\n    '\n  tables: []\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: ''\n- name: 2-way vs 3-way Routing Ablation\n  plan_id: plan-006\n  description: '对比 {internal, deterministic} 二分类 router 与 {fast-internal, deep-internal,\n    deterministic} 三分类 router。测试 fast/deep 区分是否增加额外价值。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    three_way_score: 90.2\n    two_way_score: 87.6\n    delta: 2.6\n    two_way_simulator_invocation_ratio_pct: 36.8\n    three_way_simulator_invocation_ratio_pct: 34.2\n    two_way_total_tokens_vs_three_way_pct: '+18'\n    statistical_significance: p=0.08 (marginal)\n  result_rationale: '3-way 比 2-way 高 2.6 分，差异 marginal（p=0.08）。这是 best 档下的合理预期： fast/deep\n    区分的价值来自 token 效率而非最终 score——2-way router 在 \"internal\"  类别上默认使用 deep reasoning（更多\n    token），导致 +18% token 开销但 score 接近。 少数 task type（简单导航）上 fast-internal 足够，3-way\n    router 在这些步骤节省 token 且略微减少 context 膨胀带来的 attention 分散。 这个结果简化叙事：论文可以说 \"binary\n    simulate-or-not 是核心决策， 3-way routing 提供额外的 compute-efficiency 收益但 score 差异不显著\"，\n    让 story 聚焦在 deterministic routing 的安全价值上。\n\n    '\n  tables: []\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: ''\n- name: Boil Task Rerun (v3 code)\n  plan_id: plan-007\n  description: '用 v3 clean code 重跑 boil task 20 episodes，替换 MVP 中使用旧代码（>= tie-break,\n    death filter on all 3 modes）的数据。统一分析框架。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    boil_v3_internal_mean: -44.2\n    boil_v3_det_mean: -8.3\n    boil_v3_oracle_mean: 8.7\n    boil_v3_det_minus_internal: 35.9\n    boil_v3_oracle_minus_det: 17.0\n    boil_v3_death_rate_internal_pct: 55\n    boil_v3_death_rate_det_pct: 12\n    bootstrap_90ci_det_minus_internal:\n    - 22.4\n    - 49.4\n    delta_vs_mvp_internal: +5.6 (v3 slightly better due to cleaner death accounting)\n  result_rationale: 'V3 代码修正了两个 MVP 问题：(1) tie-break 从 >= 改为严格最优， (2) death filter\n    逻辑统一。这使 internal baseline 略微上升（-44.2 vs MVP -49.8）， 因为 tie-break 修正避免了部分不必要的 deterministic\n    label 被标为 \"best\"。 Deterministic 也上升（-8.3 vs MVP -19.7），因为 death filter 现在正确过滤了\n    deterministic 模式本身的 spurious death（MVP 中未过滤导致虚高的 death penalty）。 Oracle 从 -29.7\n    跃升至 8.7，因为 v3 代码的 hindsight labeling 更准确， 选择了真正最优的 modality 而非被 tie-break 偏差的\n    modality。 核心信号不变：det_minus_internal 35.9 分，death rate 从 55% 降至 12%， 与 melt/change_state\n    的 pattern 一致，支持 pooled analysis。\n\n    '\n  tables: []\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: ''\n- name: Router Size Ablation\n  plan_id: plan-008\n  description: '对比 Qwen3-1.7B vs Qwen2.5-1.5B vs Qwen2.5-3B 作为 router。 同一训练数据和超参数。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    qwen3_1_7b_accuracy_pct: 81.3\n    qwen3_1_7b_simgate_score: 90.2\n    qwen2_5_1_5b_accuracy_pct: 76.8\n    qwen2_5_1_5b_simgate_score: 86.9\n    qwen2_5_3b_accuracy_pct: 82.1\n    qwen2_5_3b_simgate_score: 90.8\n    inference_latency_1_5b_ms: 12\n    inference_latency_1_7b_ms: 14\n    inference_latency_3b_ms: 23\n  result_rationale: 'Best 档下三个 router 都在可用范围内，但 Qwen3-1.7B 是最佳性价比： 1.5B 准确率下降 4.5%（76.8%），对应\n    SimGate score 降 3.3 分至 86.9—— 仍超过 CogRouter 但 margin 收窄。下降主要来自 false negative\n    增加 （遗漏高危步骤），因为 1.5B 的 context 理解能力不足以识别微妙的状态冲突。 3B 仅比 1.7B 高 0.8%（82.1%），对应 SimGate\n    +0.6 分——收益递减， 而推理延迟增加 64%（23ms vs 14ms）。 这支持 \"lightweight router suffices\" 的主张：1.7B\n    是 sweet spot， 1.5B 勉强可用但 margin 不够舒适，3B 无额外价值但增加开销。\n\n    '\n  tables: []\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: ''\n- name: MATH Track — Code Interpreter Routing\n  plan_id: plan-009\n  description: '500 道 MATH Level 4-5 问题。3-way routing: fast-internal / deep-internal\n    / code-interpreter。 验证 SimGate 框架泛化到代码解释器。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    simgate_math_accuracy_pct: 71.4\n    always_internal_accuracy_pct: 58.2\n    always_code_accuracy_pct: 64.8\n    oracle_accuracy_pct: 76.3\n    code_invocation_ratio_pct: 38.5\n    delta_simgate_vs_internal: 13.2\n    delta_simgate_vs_always_code: 6.6\n    high_gain_categories:\n    - algebra\n    - number-theory\n    - counting-probability\n    low_gain_categories:\n    - geometry\n    - precalculus\n  result_rationale: 'MATH 上 SimGate 的增益模式与 ScienceWorld 类似但幅度较小： code interpreter\n    在代数和数论上提供 ground-truth 计算，避免 LLM 的算术错误 （类似 ScienceWorld 的 death avoidance——算错\n    → 全题错 → 0 分）。 Always-code 低于 SimGate 6.6 分，因为几何和预微积分问题需要 空间推理和符号操作，code interpreter\n    反而不如 LLM 的 chain-of-thought。 Oracle 76.3% 设定了上限——并非所有 MATH 错误都能通过 routing 解决 （部分问题\n    LLM 和 code interpreter 都做不对）。 这个结果作为 P2 补充实验，证明 \"safety-aware routing\" 框架 泛化到\n    deterministic computation 的其他形式（code interpreter）， 但不列入 main text（short paper\n    聚焦 ScienceWorld），放 appendix 或 future work 段落。\n\n    '\n  tables: []\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: ''\n- name: Cross-Task Transfer\n  plan_id: plan-010\n  description: 'Train router on chemistry tasks only → evaluate on physics tasks（及反向）。\n    测试 routing pattern 是否跨 task domain 迁移。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    chemistry_train_physics_eval_accuracy_pct: 73.2\n    physics_train_chemistry_eval_accuracy_pct: 70.8\n    full_train_accuracy_pct: 81.3\n    chemistry_to_physics_simgate_score: 85.4\n    physics_to_chemistry_simgate_score: 83.1\n    transfer_gap_pct: 8.1\n    shared_failure_modes_pct: 62\n  result_rationale: Cross-task transfer 展示了 moderate 的泛化能力（准确率下降 ~8-10%）， 这在 best\n    档下是合理的：chemistry 和 physics task 共享 62% 的 failure modes （FM1 温度物理和 FM2 状态持久性在两个\n    domain 都出现），所以 router 学到的 \"observation 中出现状态冲突信号 → route to deterministic\" 的 pattern\n    可以迁移。 下降的 8-10% 来自 domain-specific failure modes（化学反应产物 vs 物理量守恒）， 这些 pattern\n    在跨域训练中未见过。 Chemistry→Physics transfer 略优于反向（73.2% vs 70.8%），因为化学 task  的 failure\n    pattern 更多样（反应类型多），提供了更丰富的训练信号。 这个结果支持 A4（counterfactual labels 跨 task type 泛化良好），\n    同时说明 full-task 训练仍有价值——router 不是纯 domain-agnostic 的， 但共享的物理/状态推理 failure pattern\n    提供了可迁移的基础。\n  tables: []\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: ''\n","numLines":376,"startLine":1,"totalLines":376}}}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01EYVgqqpQdvgyWXEnk6cVbB","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I've now read both the paper PDF and the review context YAML. Let me understand the task:\n\n1. I need to perform a full review using the dream-review-full dispatch template\n2. Two reviewers: R1 (methods + experiments), R2 (novelty + related work)\n3. Full roundtable: Step 1 independent → Step 2 cross-share → Step 3 converge → Step 4 synthesize\n4. Score on 6-point scale (1=Strong Reject … 6=Strong Accept), top ML venue ~25% acceptance rate\n5. After completing, call submit_dream_review_report\n\n\n6. I'll dispatch both reviewers in parallel and then synthesize their findings through the roundtable process\n\nLet me check what experiments are outlined in the review context versus what the paper actually presents. The YAML describes a series of planned experiments including counterfactual trajectory collection across multiple task types, router training on a specific model, end-to-end evaluation of the SimGate approach, ablation studies comparing routing strategies, and per-task routing pattern analysis.\n\nLooking at the paper's coverage, all ten planned experiments appear to be included. The counterfactual collection and router training show up in the methodology sections with supporting tables in the appendices, the main evaluation results are in the core sections with ablation studies following, and the routing pattern analysis is documented in the later sections.\n\nNow I'm setting up R1 and R2 to run their evaluations in parallel.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":3,"cache_creation_input_tokens":24984,"cache_read_input_tokens":22946,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":24984},"output_tokens":19,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"6a0c8153-cc84-4377-89ae-d65d2a8c9d37","uuid":"d6bb686d-da44-47b9-9409-fa72394d3574"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01EYVgqqpQdvgyWXEnk6cVbB","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Dispatching two parallel reviewers: R1 (methods + experiments) and R2 (novelty + related work)."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":3,"cache_creation_input_tokens":24984,"cache_read_input_tokens":22946,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":24984},"output_tokens":19,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"6a0c8153-cc84-4377-89ae-d65d2a8c9d37","uuid":"bbf4cc26-a968-41a3-9412-e4f1d3a562eb"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01EYVgqqpQdvgyWXEnk6cVbB","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01BQucd4DjBbRFSudKgJmpLp","name":"Agent","input":{"description":"R1: Methods + Experiments review","prompt":"You are Reviewer R1 for a top ML venue paper review. Your focus areas are **methods** and **experiments**. Score on a 6-point scale (1=Strong Reject, 2=Reject, 3=Weak Reject, 4=Weak Accept, 5=Accept, 6=Strong Accept). Target venue acceptance rate ~25%.\n\n## Paper Summary\n\n**Title**: SimGate: Safety-Aware Routing to Deterministic Computation for LLM Agents in Rule-Governed Environments\n\n**Core idea**: A modular framework with a lightweight 1.7B router that learns *when* to route LLM agent actions to a deterministic environment simulator, trained via counterfactual trajectory labeling.\n\n## Method (Section 2)\nThree stages:\n1. **Counterfactual Trajectory Collection**: Qwen2.5-7B agent on ScienceWorld, 18 task types × 20 episodes = 360 total, max 30 steps/episode. At each step, fork into 3 modalities: fast-internal (direct LLM), deep-internal (CoT), deterministic (simulator). Hindsight labeling picks best modality → ~8,200 labeled tuples. Label distribution: fast-internal 38%, deep-internal 24%, deterministic 38%. Among deterministic: 72% death avoidance, 28% positive guidance.\n2. **Router Training**: SFT Qwen3-1.7B as 3-class router. 80/20 episode-level split (~6,560/~1,640). lr=2e-5, batch=32, 3 epochs, max_seq_len=2048. Converges epoch 2.4, val accuracy 81.3% (det class 84.7%, internal classes 78.9%, macro F1 0.79).\n3. **Inference-Time Routing**: Router classifies each step → invokes simulator only when predicting \"deterministic\" → 34.2% invocation ratio.\n\n## Experiments (Section 3)\n\n### Main Results (Table 1)\n- SimGate: 90.2 [87.1, 93.3] (CogRouter protocol)\n- CogRouter: 84.6, ITP-R: 62.58\n- Always-internal: 52.8 (42.3% catastrophic failure rate)\n- Always-deterministic: 73.4\n- SimGate catastrophic failure: 11.7% (72.3% reduction)\n- Oracle: 93.1 (gap only 2.9)\n- Random routing: 64.5, confidence heuristic: 71.8\n\n### Explicit vs Implicit (Table 2)\n- Explicit (SimGate): 90.2, Sim 34.2%, FN 8.3%\n- Implicit: 78.8, Sim 52.3%, FN 18.7%\n- Delta: +11.4 [7.2, 15.6]\n\n### Per-Task Routing Pattern Analysis (Section 3.4)\n- 4 task clusters identified by routing density\n- 5 failure modes: FM1 temperature physics (34%), FM2 state persistence (22%), FM3 chemical combination (18%), FM4 multi-step causality (15%), FM5 quantity tracking (11%)\n- Phase distribution: early 18.4%, mid 48.7%, late 32.9%\n- Positive guidance on 4 task types\n\n### Additional Ablations (Section 3.5)\n- **2-way vs 3-way**: binary 87.6 vs 3-way 90.2 (p=0.08 marginal), binary uses 18% more tokens\n- **Router size** (Table 3): 1.5B→86.9, 1.7B→90.2, 3B→90.8 (latency 12/14/23ms)\n- **Cross-task transfer** (Table 8): chem→phys 73.2% acc / 85.4 score; phys→chem 70.8% / 83.1; full 81.3% / 90.2\n\n### Appendices\n- A: Data collection details (Table 4)\n- B: Router training details (Table 5)\n- C: Boil task v3 rerun (Table 6) — v3 internal -44.2, det -8.3, oracle +8.7\n- D: 2-way vs 3-way details\n- E: MATH track code interpreter routing (Table 7) — SimGate 71.4% vs internal 58.2%, code 64.8%, oracle 76.3%\n- F: Cross-task transfer details\n\n## Experiment Design Reference (what was planned)\n10 experiments were planned. The paper covers all 10:\n1. Counterfactual trajectory collection (18 task types) ✓\n2. Router SFT training ✓\n3. End-to-end evaluation ✓\n4. Explicit vs implicit ablation ✓\n5. Per-task routing pattern analysis ✓\n6. 2-way vs 3-way ablation ✓\n7. Boil task v3 rerun ✓\n8. Router size ablation ✓\n9. MATH code interpreter routing ✓\n10. Cross-task transfer ✓\n\n## Your Review Task\n\nProduce a detailed review covering:\n\n1. **Summary** (2-3 sentences)\n2. **Strengths** (methods + experiments, bulleted)\n3. **Weaknesses** (methods + experiments, bulleted)\n4. **Questions to Authors** (specific, numbered)\n5. **Minor Issues**\n6. **Preliminary Score** (1-6) with confidence (1-5) and a one-line justification\n\nFocus specifically on:\n- Methodological soundness (counterfactual labeling, SFT training, evaluation protocol)\n- Experimental rigor (baselines, statistical significance, ablations, reproducibility)\n- Whether the experimental evidence supports the claims\n- Missing experiments or controls\n- Potential confounds or methodological gaps\n\nBe rigorous. A top venue with 25% acceptance means most papers are rejected.\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":3,"cache_creation_input_tokens":24984,"cache_read_input_tokens":22946,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":24984},"output_tokens":19,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"6a0c8153-cc84-4377-89ae-d65d2a8c9d37","uuid":"840bb9e8-8572-4067-af57-6011afc80cc7"}
{"type":"system","subtype":"task_started","task_id":"ae094fae74958fe18","tool_use_id":"toolu_01BQucd4DjBbRFSudKgJmpLp","description":"R1: Methods + Experiments review","task_type":"local_agent","prompt":"You are Reviewer R1 for a top ML venue paper review. Your focus areas are **methods** and **experiments**. Score on a 6-point scale (1=Strong Reject, 2=Reject, 3=Weak Reject, 4=Weak Accept, 5=Accept, 6=Strong Accept). Target venue acceptance rate ~25%.\n\n## Paper Summary\n\n**Title**: SimGate: Safety-Aware Routing to Deterministic Computation for LLM Agents in Rule-Governed Environments\n\n**Core idea**: A modular framework with a lightweight 1.7B router that learns *when* to route LLM agent actions to a deterministic environment simulator, trained via counterfactual trajectory labeling.\n\n## Method (Section 2)\nThree stages:\n1. **Counterfactual Trajectory Collection**: Qwen2.5-7B agent on ScienceWorld, 18 task types × 20 episodes = 360 total, max 30 steps/episode. At each step, fork into 3 modalities: fast-internal (direct LLM), deep-internal (CoT), deterministic (simulator). Hindsight labeling picks best modality → ~8,200 labeled tuples. Label distribution: fast-internal 38%, deep-internal 24%, deterministic 38%. Among deterministic: 72% death avoidance, 28% positive guidance.\n2. **Router Training**: SFT Qwen3-1.7B as 3-class router. 80/20 episode-level split (~6,560/~1,640). lr=2e-5, batch=32, 3 epochs, max_seq_len=2048. Converges epoch 2.4, val accuracy 81.3% (det class 84.7%, internal classes 78.9%, macro F1 0.79).\n3. **Inference-Time Routing**: Router classifies each step → invokes simulator only when predicting \"deterministic\" → 34.2% invocation ratio.\n\n## Experiments (Section 3)\n\n### Main Results (Table 1)\n- SimGate: 90.2 [87.1, 93.3] (CogRouter protocol)\n- CogRouter: 84.6, ITP-R: 62.58\n- Always-internal: 52.8 (42.3% catastrophic failure rate)\n- Always-deterministic: 73.4\n- SimGate catastrophic failure: 11.7% (72.3% reduction)\n- Oracle: 93.1 (gap only 2.9)\n- Random routing: 64.5, confidence heuristic: 71.8\n\n### Explicit vs Implicit (Table 2)\n- Explicit (SimGate): 90.2, Sim 34.2%, FN 8.3%\n- Implicit: 78.8, Sim 52.3%, FN 18.7%\n- Delta: +11.4 [7.2, 15.6]\n\n### Per-Task Routing Pattern Analysis (Section 3.4)\n- 4 task clusters identified by routing density\n- 5 failure modes: FM1 temperature physics (34%), FM2 state persistence (22%), FM3 chemical combination (18%), FM4 multi-step causality (15%), FM5 quantity tracking (11%)\n- Phase distribution: early 18.4%, mid 48.7%, late 32.9%\n- Positive guidance on 4 task types\n\n### Additional Ablations (Section 3.5)\n- **2-way vs 3-way**: binary 87.6 vs 3-way 90.2 (p=0.08 marginal), binary uses 18% more tokens\n- **Router size** (Table 3): 1.5B→86.9, 1.7B→90.2, 3B→90.8 (latency 12/14/23ms)\n- **Cross-task transfer** (Table 8): chem→phys 73.2% acc / 85.4 score; phys→chem 70.8% / 83.1; full 81.3% / 90.2\n\n### Appendices\n- A: Data collection details (Table 4)\n- B: Router training details (Table 5)\n- C: Boil task v3 rerun (Table 6) — v3 internal -44.2, det -8.3, oracle +8.7\n- D: 2-way vs 3-way details\n- E: MATH track code interpreter routing (Table 7) — SimGate 71.4% vs internal 58.2%, code 64.8%, oracle 76.3%\n- F: Cross-task transfer details\n\n## Experiment Design Reference (what was planned)\n10 experiments were planned. The paper covers all 10:\n1. Counterfactual trajectory collection (18 task types) ✓\n2. Router SFT training ✓\n3. End-to-end evaluation ✓\n4. Explicit vs implicit ablation ✓\n5. Per-task routing pattern analysis ✓\n6. 2-way vs 3-way ablation ✓\n7. Boil task v3 rerun ✓\n8. Router size ablation ✓\n9. MATH code interpreter routing ✓\n10. Cross-task transfer ✓\n\n## Your Review Task\n\nProduce a detailed review covering:\n\n1. **Summary** (2-3 sentences)\n2. **Strengths** (methods + experiments, bulleted)\n3. **Weaknesses** (methods + experiments, bulleted)\n4. **Questions to Authors** (specific, numbered)\n5. **Minor Issues**\n6. **Preliminary Score** (1-6) with confidence (1-5) and a one-line justification\n\nFocus specifically on:\n- Methodological soundness (counterfactual labeling, SFT training, evaluation protocol)\n- Experimental rigor (baselines, statistical significance, ablations, reproducibility)\n- Whether the experimental evidence supports the claims\n- Missing experiments or controls\n- Potential confounds or methodological gaps\n\nBe rigorous. A top venue with 25% acceptance means most papers are rejected.\n","uuid":"7c8df98d-e0e8-46b0-8a35-5db80288ba35","session_id":"6a0c8153-cc84-4377-89ae-d65d2a8c9d37"}
