{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01MgRjngx8SesVswpVSLowuS","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_12/projects/simgate-modular-routing/decisions.yaml\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"_next_id: 7\\\\ndecisions:\\\\n- id: D001\\\\n  date: 2026-05-13 04:25 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'MVP 方案: ScienceWorld 信号检测——验证确定性模拟是否在规则驱动任务上优于 LLM 内部推理'\\\\n  rationale: 12 天 deadline 下必须快速验证核心假设。ScienceWorld 是 primary track，其 JVM 后端提供精确的规则化状态转移，与\\\\n    LLM 近似推理的差距应该最大。选 5 task types × 10 episodes 的小规模 counterfactual 比较，不训练 router，纯信号检测。Pass\\\\n    标准 ≥2/5 task types >5pp，基于 ITP-R vs CogRouter 7.4pp 差距的量级。\\\\n  related_experiments: []\\\\n  depends_on: []\\\\n- id: D002\\\\n  date: 2026-05-13 04:28 UTC\\\\n  summary: 采纳 Reviewer 全部 4 条 warning，修订 MVP 为 Phase 0 + Phase 1 两阶段方案\\\\n  rationale: Reviewer 指出 D001 方案 3 个操作层缺陷：(1) counterfactual 方法未明确——改为 episode-level\\\\n    3-way (always-internal / always-deterministic / oracle-routing)，oracle 作为 selective\\\\n    routing 上界；(2) N=10 统计功效不足——增加到 20 episodes/task type + bootstrap 90% CI；(3) kill\\\\n    criteria 不完整——增加 Phase 0 工程 gate、灰区 conditional pass、pre-register 5 task types\\\\n    (3S+1M+1W)。无额外 GPU 成本，仅设计层修正。\\\\n  related_experiments: []\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D001\\\\n- id: D003\\\\n  date: 2026-05-13 07:43 UTC\\\\n  summary: GPU0 继续收集 baseline，GPU1 停下修复 tie-break + 致死动作过滤后重跑\\\\n  rationale: Fork 诊断发现两个方法论缺陷：(1) tie-break >= 使 95% delta=0 步骤 oracle 永远选 internal，oracle\\\\n    数据不可信；(2) 致死动作 (score=-100) 污染三条线。修 >= 为 >（oracle 仅在 deterministic 严格更优时介入）+ 致死动作过滤。不做\\\\n    N-step rollout——1-step 局限性是真实发现，MVP 应如实反映。GPU0 baseline 数据有效，不浪费已有进度。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp-p1-gpu0\\\\n    role: baseline data, continue\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp-p1-gpu1-vllm\\\\n    role: kill, fix, rerun\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D002\\\\n- id: D004\\\\n  date: 2026-05-13 08:13 UTC\\\\n  summary: MVP 判定 primary metric 改为 always-deterministic vs always-internal，oracle\\\\n    降为 supplementary\\\\n  rationale: 1-step lookahead 在稀疏 reward 下 95% 步骤 delta=0，任何 tie-break 都使 oracle 退化（>=\\\\n    → always-internal，> → always-deterministic）。这是 1-step 的本质局限而非 bug。直接比较 det vs\\\\n    internal 能回答核心问题\\\\\\\"确定性计算有没有用\\\\\\\"，无需 oracle 作为中介。oracle 在密集 reward tasks 上仍有参考价值。\\\\n  related_experiments: []\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D003\\\\n- id: D005\\\\n  date: 2026-05-13 15:25 UTC\\\\n  summary: MVP Phase 1 判定 PASS — det > internal 在 ≥2/5 task types 上统计显著，oracle > det\\\\n    信号支持 router 训练\\\\n  rationale: melt (+40.15, CI [25, 60.15]) 和 change-state (+40.2, CI [25, 60.15])\\\\n    满足 ≥2/5 Pass 标准。mix-paint (+35.5) 大概率也通过。grow-plant (0.0) 符合预期（pre-registered\\\\n    weak/对照）。最关键发现：oracle > det（melt +16.7, change-state +14.95, mix-paint +10.0）证明\\\\n    selective routing 有额外增量——这是 SimGate router 训练的信号来源。信号机制是 death avoidance（避免 -100\\\\n    致死动作）而非正向引导，论文 framing 需定位为 safety-aware routing。待确认：melt/change-state 数据重复性、mix-paint\\\\n    CI、boil v3 重跑。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp-p1-gpu0\\\\n    role: boil data (old code)\\\\n    result: det-int +30.1\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp-p1-gpu0-vllm\\\\n    role: melt+change-state (v3)\\\\n    result: det-int +40.15/+40.2, CI [25, 60.15]\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp-p1-gpu1-v3\\\\n    role: mix-paint+grow-plant (v3)\\\\n    result: det-int +35.5/0.0\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D004\\\\n- id: D006\\\\n  date: 2026-05-13 15:37 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'Research phase plan revised per Reviewer W1-W5: 2-way first, signal pre-screening,\\\\n    parameter-controlled ablation, GPU units fixed'\\\\n  rationale: 'Reviewer 提出 5 个实质性问题全部采纳: (1) C1 \\\\\\\"selective > unconditional\\\\\\\" 标注为待确认;\\\\n    (2) 2-way collection 优先，与 MVP 一致且省 33% GPU; (3) plan-001 增加 mini signal detection\\\\n    前置步骤避免浪费 GPU; (4) plan-004 增加 1.7B implicit 控制条件隔离架构效果; (5) GPU 预算改为 RTX 5090\\\\n    实际时长。melt/change-state 确认非重复但共享 variations，论文中合并报告。'\\\\n  related_experiments: []\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D005\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 3381, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01BQucd4DjBbRFSudKgJmpLp","session_id":"6a0c8153-cc84-4377-89ae-d65d2a8c9d37","uuid":"9fe25164-5488-4674-8585-a52417d7f50b","timestamp":"2026-05-13T16:05:57.259Z"}
